<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Pheromone Glands</ansi> mutation

Your body exudes compelling pheromones that charm other people.
Predatory beasts, however, find you irresistible prey.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Significantly increased charisma — your pheromones make you
  unusually persuasive and appealing to other people

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
